fetch her!?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb the under-construction <i>New Pekora Tower</i>, serving as an orbital elevator, to reach the moon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hurry, Peko-chan! Go pick up Moona before the stream starts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rabbit can only leap toward the moon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971290/extras/keyvisual.jpg?t=1780044903\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect “Memories”</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By obtaining items, you can unlock the gallery and learn the stories behind the platform objects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By the time you’ve climbed to the top, you’ll be a Hololive expert!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971290/extras/396e13dbebdc022bb463d3bd2d9a51a2.avif?t=1780044903\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971290/extras/0d526a9b84d6a9999c8de9a4c402046c.avif?t=1780044903\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Make the Most of</strong> <strong>Mascot Balloons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By obtaining mascot balloons placed throughout the stage, you’ll be able to use the gliding action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gliding can be used both for progression and to prevent falling, but the number of balloons is limited — timing is everything!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971290/extras/a3fedd0bc6610ceb1fc9eed6bbacaa1d.avif?t=1780044903\"